<h2>Professional Summary</h2>
<p>Results-driven Web Developer with extensive experience in designing, building, and maintaining modern responsive web applications. Proven expertise in <strong>Next.js</strong>, <strong>React</strong>, and <strong>Node.js</strong>, with a strong focus on performance optimization, SEO, and seamless REST API integration. Adept at working in remote environments, managing full lifecycle development—from UI component creation to backend logic and cloud deployment. Passionate about delivering high-quality digital solutions and enhancing user experiences through robust code and innovative problem-solving.</p>

